WEBVTT

00:06:59.707 --> 00:07:03.043
"A lonely road is a bodyguard."

00:07:05.880 --> 00:07:07.256
What did it mean?

00:07:08.674 --> 00:07:11.844
I had even pasted a picture
of this empty road

00:07:11.886 --> 00:07:13.888
next to the line.

00:07:14.388 --> 00:07:15.681
It was a metaphor.

00:07:17.475 --> 00:07:23.314
It wasn't "a lonely road
is like a bodyguard," a simile.

00:07:24.148 --> 00:07:29.111
It was the much more poetic:
“A lonely road is a bodyguard.”